{"id":"H7321","lemma":"רוּעַ","transliteration":"rua","sayIt":"ru-a","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to shout","meaning":"1) to shout, raise a sound, cry out, give a blast\n1a) (Hiphil)\n1a1) to shout a war-cry or alarm of battle\n1a2) to sound a signal for war or march\n1a3) to shout in triumph (over enemies)\n1a4) to shout in applause\n1a5) to shout (with religious impulse)\n1a6) to cry out in distress\n1b) (Polal) to utter a shout\n1c) (Hithpolel)\n1c1) to shout in triumph\n1c2) to shout for joy\n2) (Niphal) destroyed","glosses":["shout","shout in triumph","make a joyful noise","shouted","shouts","shout aloud"],"count":40,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"num-10","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"short ones"}},{"chapterId":"num-10","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"sound short blasts","kjv":"then ye shall blow an alarm"}},{"chapterId":"jos-6","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"shout","kjv":"shall shout"}},{"chapterId":"jos-6","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"a battle cry or","kjv":"Ye shall not shout"}},{"chapterId":"jos-6","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shout","kjv":"Shout"}},{"chapterId":"jos-6","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"shouted","kjv":"shouted"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-7","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"crying out","kjv":"and cried"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-15","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"came out shouting","kjv":"shouted"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-4","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"shout","kjv":"shouted"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-10","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"Long","kjv":"shouted"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-17","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"and shouting","kjv":"and shouted"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-17","v":52,"renderings":{"bsb":"with a shout","kjv":"and shouted"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-13","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"sound","kjv":"to cry alarm"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-13","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"raised the battle cry","kjv":"gave a shout"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-3","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"shout","kjv":"shouted"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-3","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"were making so much noise","kjv":"shouted"}},{"chapterId"